# Run Individual Reports

Every report goal can run on its own, without configuring anything in the POM and without building
the whole site. For example, to generate only the Dependencies report:

```shell
mvn project-info-reports:dependencies
```

The report is written to `target/reports/dependencies.html`; set `outputDirectory` to change the directory.
See [Plugin Documentation](../plugin-info.html) for the complete list of goals.

A report generated this way has no site navigation, and its texts are in the locale given by the
`locale` parameter, not the JVM locale. Configure the parameter in the `<build>` section of the POM:

```xml
<build>
  <plugins>
    <plugin>
      <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
      <artifactId>maven-project-info-reports-plugin</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
      <configuration>
        <locale>de</locale>
      </configuration>
    </plugin>
  </plugins>
</build>
```
